      "created_at": "2026-01-07T09:15:34.114Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In <strong>Stock → Item → Description</strong>, there is an option to attach an image. However, when I add an image and click <strong>Save</strong>, the image is not retained and gets removed automatically.</p>\n<p>Has anyone encountered this issue or has any idea why the image is not being saved?</p>\n<p><strong>Steps:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Add an image in the <em>Description</em> field.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n<li>The image disappears after saving.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Screenshots attached for reference:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Image before saving<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f_2_690x286.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5qlrsPUf8JGpmBgDK2s1l8Ize6b\" width=\"690\" height=\"286\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f_2_690x286.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f_2_1035x429.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/260546191c98007b5e1726af59a0f2a189775a1f_2_1380x572.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E0E2E4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1733×719 161 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n<li>Image after saving<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/5/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677_2_690x316.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9UMBqjbKrwJv9795Jw3nqHWOla7\" width=\"690\" height=\"316\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677_2_690x316.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677_2_1035x474.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/457ecba777afc7c33d8492c0faeeca0c0f588677_2_1380x632.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F2F2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1697×778 105 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Any insights would be appreciated.</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
