      "created_at": "2026-01-08T05:44:33.603Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In Stock Settings, disable the <strong>Convert Item Description to Clean HTML in Transactions</strong> checkbox.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubissue\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51577\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51577\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/erpnext</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n  <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Issue\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n\t  <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n    <h4>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51577\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Item description image upload unsuccessful on save.</a>\n    </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"github-info\">\n      <div class=\"date\">\n        opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2026-01-07\" data-time=\"21:03:15\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">09:03PM - 07 Jan 26 UTC</span>\n      </div>\n\n        <div class=\"date\">\n          closed <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2026-01-08\" data-time=\"05:13:34\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">05:13AM - 08 Jan 26 UTC</span>\n        </div>\n\n      <div class=\"user\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/akhtarmohsin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167299936?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n          akhtarmohsin\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"labels\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          bug\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          stock\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          invalid\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          internal\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">### Information about bug\n\nImages added to Stock &gt; Item &gt; Description are discar<span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">ded immediately upon clicking \"Save.\"\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nNavigate to Stock &gt; Item.\n\nOpen an Item Description.\n\nAttach a valid image file.\n\nClick \"Save.\"\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d24d2e1e-6385-4181-b148-04c503c39d29)\n\n&lt;img width=\"1380\" height=\"632\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb0cd789-1330-4a58-9861-d72b4dca8d4a\" /&gt;\n\n### Module\n\nstock\n\n### Version\n\nversion 15\n\n### Installation method\n\nNone\n\n### Relevant log output / Stack trace / Full Error Message.\n\n```shell\n\n```</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
